# landing_ground_effect_float.expect — a LANDING held above the floor by the ground effect ends by the stalled-descent verdict
# 地面効果が床の上に留める LANDING は、降下停滞の判定で終わる
#
# Measured (--ground-effect): FLYING -> LANDING at 13.02 s; "Landing detected (stalled descent / ground effect)"; LANDING -> IDLE_GROUND at 15.62 s, the motors stop at a true height of 0.045 m.
# 実測（--ground-effect）: FLYING → LANDING は 13.02 s、「Landing detected (stalled descent / ground effect)」、LANDING → IDLE_GROUND は 15.62 s、モータは真の高さ 0.045 m で止まる。
exit 0
log_contains any "Transition: FLYING → LANDING"
log_contains any "Landing detected (stalled descent / ground effect)"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
order "Transition: FLYING → LANDING" "Landing detected (stalled descent" "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
metric duty_max > 0.50 in 13.5 14.5
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 16.0 19.0
